382 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Second-year, 3rd-semester students presented their project \215Electrostatic Foam Suppression Module\216 authored by Shreni C Shetty \(IEM\), R Shradha \(IEM\), P V Sai Amuktha \(CSE\), and Mahathi Adiraju \(ASE\) under the mentorship of Dr. Shwetha K P \(Physics Dept.\). Their paper has been published in IJRASET.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[12 13]>>
