561 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(On September 22, 2025, RVCE proudly formalized a new academic partnership by signing a Memorandum of Understanding \(MoU\) with the HOF University of Applied Sciences, Germany. This collaboration marks a significant milestone, making HOF University our sixth esteemed German partner institution.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[14 15]>>
endobj

562 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The partnership is poised to integrate seamlessly with RVCE\220s established Indo-German Collaborative Programs, which already include successful engagements with THWS, THR, and HTW Dresden. The visiting delegation from HOF University expressed strong interest in contributing to these initiatives.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

